(TOURISM EXPERIENCE ANALYTICS) Tj
T*
(FINAL PROJECT REPORT \(ENHANCED SUBMISSION\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY) Tj
T*
(This project builds a complete analytics system for tourism platforms with three integrated AI) Tj
T*
(capabilities:) Tj
T*
(1. Rating prediction \(regression\)) Tj
T*
(2. Visit mode prediction \(classification\)) Tj
T*
(3. Personalized attraction recommendation \(collaborative filtering\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The solution includes data preprocessing, EDA, visual analytics, ML model training/evaluation,) Tj
T*
(and an interactive Streamlit application for business-facing usage.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. PROBLEM STATEMENT AND BUSINESS OBJECTIVES) Tj
T*
(Tourism businesses need to improve user experience and retention by understanding behavior and) Tj
T*
(delivering personalization at scale. This project addresses:) Tj
T*
(- Predict likely attraction rating before a trip or campaign launch.) Tj
T*
(- Classify visitor type \(Business, Family, Friends, Couples, Solo\) for targeted offers.) Tj
T*
(- Recommend attractions aligned with user history and similar-user patterns.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. DATASET OVERVIEW) Tj
T*
(Integrated tourism dataset after consolidation:) Tj
T*
(- Total transactions: 52,930) Tj
T*
(- Unique users: 33,530) Tj
T*
(- Unique attractions: 30) Tj
T*
(- Time range: 2013 to 2022) Tj
T*
(- Average rating: 4.158 / 5) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Core fields used:) Tj
T*
(- Behavioral: VisitYear, VisitMonth, VisitModeId, Rating) Tj
T*
(- Location: ContinentId, RegionId, CountryId, CityId) Tj
T*
(- Attraction: AttractionId, AttractionTypeId, AttractionCityId, Attraction) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. DATA CLEANING AND PREPROCESSING) Tj
T*
(Processing was performed using a reproducible Python pipeline.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4.1 CLEANING STEPS) Tj
T*
