T*
(Unknown.) Tj
T*
(- Enforced numeric consistency for ID columns and temporal fields.) Tj
T*
(- Validated and clipped ratings to the valid 1-5 range.) Tj
T*
(- Exported final cleaned dataset to data/processed/cleaned_tourism.csv.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
