T*
(partnerships.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. FEATURE ENGINEERING AND MODELING STRATEGY) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.1 REGRESSION TASK) Tj
T*
(Target: Rating) Tj
T*
(- Candidate models: RandomForestRegressor, GradientBoostingRegressor) Tj
T*
(- Selected by best RMSE on hold-out test split) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.2 CLASSIFICATION TASK) Tj
T*
(Target: VisitModeId) Tj
T*
(- Candidate models: RandomForestClassifier, GradientBoostingClassifier) Tj
T*
(- Selected by weighted F1 on hold-out test split) Tj
T*
(- Leakage prevention applied \(target VisitModeId is not used as input feature\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.3 RECOMMENDATION TASK) Tj
T*
(- Method: User-based collaborative filtering using KNN with cosine similarity) Tj
T*
(- Data structure: user-item matrix \(UserId x AttractionId\) built from ratings) Tj
T*
(- Output: top-N unseen attractions from nearest user neighbors) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
