T*
(7.4 PERFORMANCE DISCUSSION) Tj
T*
(- Regression captures moderate predictive signal, suitable for directional satisfaction) Tj
T*
(forecasting.) Tj
T*
(- Classification performance indicates useful segmentation potential but can improve with) Tj
T*
(richer behavioral features.) Tj
T*
(- Recommendation hit rate is low due to sparse user-level interactions, a common issue in) Tj
T*
(implicit tourism logs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. BUSINESS INSIGHTS AND RECOMMENDATIONS) Tj
T*
(- Prioritize Couples/Family-focused campaign bundles because these segments dominate volume.) Tj
T*
(- Use rating prediction to proactively identify lower-satisfaction attraction-context) Tj
T*
(combinations.) Tj
T*
(- Use visit mode classification to personalize messaging, package design, and amenity) Tj
T*
(recommendations.) Tj
T*
(- Improve recommendation quality with additional context features \(trip duration, budget,) Tj
T*
(recency, dwell time\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
