T*
(- Sparse interactions reduce recommendation precision.) Tj
T*
(- Features are primarily structured IDs; semantic attraction metadata is limited.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Next improvements:) Tj
T*
(- Hybrid recommender \(collaborative + content-based\)) Tj
T*
(- More robust feature set \(price sensitivity, seasonality intensity, travel cohort\)) Tj
T*
(- Hyperparameter tuning with cross-validation and model calibration) Tj
T*
(- Better cold-start strategy for new users and new attractions) Tj
